"""Sourced opening-cost benchmarks per business (used by venture_costs.py).

Each entry is a representative operator's "Estimated Initial Investment" (Franchise Disclosure
Document Item 7) or a cited industry figure, mapped onto common lines. Research done 2026-11-14; every
source page was re-fetched and the quoted figures confirmed on the page. Mapping rules:
  - franchise fees and franchisor-only lines (training travel, technology fees) are left out;
  - the benchmark's own rent and lease-deposit lines are left out (the listed space's rent is used);
  - lines the benchmark lists but our fields lack (pre-opening payroll, insurance, legal...) go to
    other_opening_costs, described in other_what;
  - "scales" lists the lines that grow with floor area; "per_sf" lines are $ per sq ft;
  - "unpriced" names a cost the benchmark leaves out; "comparable": False means no usable benchmark.
"""

